### - Return all discs
GET http://localhost:8000/api/discs

### - Return specific disc

GET http://localhost:8000/api/disc/SCUS-94211

### - Return 404 on failure

GET http://localhost:8000/api/disc/not-real

### - Add new disc

POST http://localhost:8000/api/discs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "SCUS-94463",
